WEB SOURCE (the specification)
  web/src/features/driving/components/drivetrain-health/HealthRecommendations.tsx — a presentational leaf fed a single
  prop { overallHealth: 'good' | 'warning' | 'critical' } (the HealthStatus union from constants.ts). A useMemo derives
  a priority-ordered maintenance-tip list, branch-by-branch:
    1. overallHealth === 'critical'             → criticalStop (high) · serviceUrgent (high)
    2. overallHealth ∈ {'warning','critical'}   → reduceLoad (medium) · checkCoolant (medium) · avoidSupercharging (medium)
    3. always                                   → regularService (low) · gentleAccel (low) · precondition (low) · monitorTemps (low)
  i.e. good → 4 tips, warning → 7 tips, critical → 9 tips. It renders FadeIn(delay 0.35) → GlassPanel(p-6):
    • header: Shield (text-neon-cyan) + h3 "Health Recommendations" (uppercase tracking-wider text-muted);
    • StaggerContainer(space-y-3) of StaggerItem cards, each a bordered row:
        high   → border-neon-red/20  bg-neon-red/5    + AlertTriangle (neon-red)
        medium → border-neon-amber/20 bg-neon-amber/5  + AlertTriangle (neon-amber)
        low    → border-subtle        bg-white/[0.02]  + TrendingUp (neon-cyan)
      with the tip copy as <p text-sm text-secondary>.
  Data hooks (from prompt): useTranslation only. Shared components: @/components/ui (GlassPanel), @/components/motion
  (FadeIn, StaggerContainer, StaggerItem). Charts/maps: (none). i18n keys (10): drivetrain.recommendations +
  drivetrain.tips.{criticalStop,serviceUrgent,reduceLoad,checkCoolant,avoidSupercharging,regularService,gentleAccel,
  precondition,monitorTemps}.

